11:09.680 --> 11:11.050
<b>Hello?</b>

11:11.050 --> 11:12.380
<b>Sukawara-san?</b>

11:12.850 --> 11:14.420
<b>Are you free right now?</b>

11:14.420 --> 11:15.350
<b>Yeah, but...</b>

11:15.350 --> 11:17.750
<b>“Yeah, but... why do you ask?”</b>

11:17.750 --> 11:18.350
<b>Yeah...</b>

11:18.950 --> 11:20.190
<b>I just want to confirm something.</b>

11:20.190 --> 11:21.060
<b>What?</b>

11:21.060 --> 11:24.230
<b>You came to me and told me you
wanted to work together.</b>

11:24.230 --> 11:27.500
<b>I’m not going to ask you why.
It doesn’t really matter to me.</b>

11:27.500 --> 11:31.340
<b>I was just glad when you told me that you’d help.</b>

11:31.340 --> 11:37.050
<b>So I’ve been wondering...
How can I lend you my strength?</b>

11:38.040 --> 11:40.410
<b>What are you hoping to do?</b>

11:40.410 --> 11:43.480
<b>Probably the same thing you are, Sukawara-san...</b>

11:43.480 --> 11:46.020
<b>I want to confirm the existence of the material fairies.</b>

11:46.020 --> 11:47.620
<b>I see.</b>

11:47.620 --> 11:50.720
<b>I want to make it clear that they exist...</b>

11:50.720 --> 11:53.990
<b>...and really show those who think
they’re nothing but nonsense.</b>

11:54.490 --> 11:56.260
<b>Yeah, thanks.</b>

11:56.260 --> 11:58.260
<b>Well then, I’ll call you again later.</b>

12:09.170 --> 12:13.150
<b>[Yamato Real Estate]</b>

12:26.760 --> 12:29.720
<b>m 192 69.625 l 266.375 453.625 630 400.75 561.625</b>

12:26.760 --> 12:29.720
<b>I know you told me to not
concern myself with you
anymore, but I just want
to say this...
I’m sorry.
But I don’t know why you
suddenly said you didn’t
care about them anymore,
Rieko-chan.</b>

12:30.360 --> 12:33.730
<b>“I know you told me to not concern myself with
you anymore, but I just want to say this...”</b>

12:33.730 --> 12:35.300
<b>“I’m sorry.”</b>

12:35.300 --> 12:39.710
<b>“But I don’t know why you suddenly said you
didn’t care about them anymore, Rieko-chan.”</b>

12:40.170 --> 12:43.640
<b>“I think I’m going to search out the material fairies...”</b>

12:43.640 --> 12:45.670
<b>“...because I’m positive that they exist.”</b>

12:45.670 --> 12:47.510
<b>“And because I think...”</b>

12:47.510 --> 12:51.010
<b>“...you might change your opinion opinion once you realize that they really do exist.”</b>

12:52.810 --> 12:54.550
<b>I already know they exist...</b>

12:57.790 --> 13:02.120
<b>I saw them too, after all.</b>

13:21.210 --> 13:22.010
<b>I’m back.</b>

13:22.540 --> 13:24.210
<b>Oh, welcome back.</b>

13:24.210 --> 13:25.950
<b>I’ll be back down right after I change.</b>

13:25.950 --> 13:27.990
<b>I’ll be counting on you for my
breaded, deep-fried oysters!</b>

13:29.720 --> 13:30.690
<b>Hello?</b>

13:30.690 --> 13:34.560
<b>It’s a problem if you try to order breaded,
deep-fried oysters from me...</b>

13:34.560 --> 13:36.660
<b>Oh, it was just something over here.</b>

13:36.660 --> 13:38.670
<b>Just what are you doing right now?</b>

13:39.230 --> 13:40.530
<b>At any rate, it’s been a while.</b>

13:40.530 --> 13:42.430
<b>Are you free to talk right now?</b>

13:42.430 --> 13:43.870
<b>Yeah, I guess...</b>

13:43.870 --> 13:46.330
<b>That didn’t sound too definitive.</b>

13:46.330 --> 13:48.870
<b>I’m still in the middle of training your replacement.</b>

13:48.870 --> 13:51.570
<b>I’m trying to leave some filler-story
digital editing to her.</b>

13:51.570 --> 13:53.910
<b>Until she finishes with that,
I should have no problem talking.</b>

13:53.910 --> 13:56.980
<b>I’m terribly sorry for placing such a burden on you.</b>

13:56.980 --> 13:58.550
<b>You’re certainly formal tonight.</b>

13:58.550 --> 13:59.710
<b>Did something happen?</b>

13:59.720 --> 14:01.520
<b>How’s the new girl?</b>

14:01.520 --> 14:03.350
<b>She’s perfect.</b>

14:03.350 --> 14:05.820
<b>She’s so perfect that she has absolutely no zest.</b>

14:05.820 --> 14:08.960
<b>If she’s no good,
you should just say so.</b>

14:08.960 --> 14:11.100
<b>I won’t complain.</b>

14:12.130 --> 14:13.730
<b>Oh, that’s right...</b>

14:13.730 --> 14:18.170
<b>You never were one to put your complaining
and grumbling into words, Doumaru-san.</b>

14:19.600 --> 14:21.170
<b>So what’s your business with me tonight?</b>

14:21.170 --> 14:25.310
<b>Well, I’m in Yokohama right now, and actually...</b>

14:25.310 --> 14:27.550
